  "level": 1,
  "question": {
    "text": "The RMS&nbsp;value of conduction current in a parallel plate capacitor is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math>. The capacity of this capacitor, if it is connected to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>230</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math>&nbsp;AC&nbsp;supply with an angular frequency of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>600</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>rad</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>, will be",
    "image": null
  },
